/EDIT HISTORY:
/
/22-NOV-78	(LHN)
/	1)  ADDED "EORTRP" FOR "SAMPLE"
/
/18-MAY-90	(LHN)
/	1) MOVED CODE TO READ UNWIND STATE 
/
/30-AUG-90	(LHN)
